OL,3,GNEWSAFailed student jailed for 28 years
OL,4,Afor murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA failed student is starting a 28-year
OL,7,Fprison sentence after a court heard how
OL,8,Fhe murdered a sex worker in a
OL,9,F"sustained and brutal" knife attack.
OL,11,FDeepak Sandhu, 24, who studied a
OL,12,FSouthampton Solent University, met
OL,13,F39-year-old Xiaoqing Ke in 2025 when
OL,14,Fshe was working in a brothel in the
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,17,FAt the trial at the Old Bailey, Judge
OL,18,FPhilip Katz sentenced him after hearing
OL,19,Fhow he had murdered the mother of two
OL,20,Fin her flat in West London on 9
OL,21,FDecember.
